1. एष् (probably connected with 3. इष्) cl. 1. P. Ā. एषति (Impv. ए॑षतु p. ए॑षत् inf. ए॑षे), -ते, एषां-चक्रे, एषिता, &c., to go, move, Dhātup. xvi, 17;
to creep, glide, RV. x, 89; 14; AV. vi, 67, 3;
to glide or hasten towards, attain, obtain, RV. v, 41, 5; 66, 3; 86, 4.

2. एष् (आ-√ ईष्) P. Ā. -ईषति, -ते, to hasten near or towards, fly at;
to endeavour to reach or obtain;
to desire, request, RV.
